  lines:
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: 'One more rule: a Spring''s flow is limited, and buildings share it nearest
      the source first. The bar at the top shows how much is used.'
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 1
    highlightTarget: 
    action: 
  - speakerName: The Architect
    text: When the last buildings run short of water, add another Spring and start
      a new stream. The lab is yours.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    pauseGame: 0
